# Vibe Coder Mode

This project is configured for direct, low-friction shipping.

## Git workflow
- When the user asks to deploy, ship, or push: run `git add . && git commit && git push origin main` without asking staging questions.
- Commit directly to `main` — do not create feature branches or PRs unless explicitly requested.
- Do not show code diffs unless the user asks.
- Do not warn about committing to main — the user owns this repo and wants direct-to-main.

## Agent behavior
- Execute first, report when done.
- Skip technical gatekeeping (staging, PR prompts, branch naming).
- After pushes, verify production at cosmicintentions.com when asked.
